  ("One or more asterisks before an example show that it is badly formed and should be avoided, e.g." 0.09203 0.90816 0.72583 0.74231 0.74231 0.01648 0.00482 0.3812 0.0356 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("*produció (for produjo), **el mujer." 0.09203 0.38113 0.74233 0.75881 0.75881 0.01648 0.00482 0.3380 0.0849 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("A preceding question mark shows that the form is controversial or doubtful: ?se los dije, ?habían" 0.09203 0.90824 0.77102 0.7875 0.7875 0.01648 0.00482 0.3195 0.0150 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
