  ("Abbreviations and conventions xi" 0.64449 0.90877 0.04923 0.06828 0.06828 0.01537 0.00558 0.2815 0.1077 "UFSJES+Palatino-Light" 0.0129 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Light" nil)
  ("[aw] is like the ‘ow’ in English ‘cow’; [ay] is like the ‘i’ in English ‘high’; [ey] is like the ‘ay’ in" 0.09195 0.90808 0.08317 0.09966 0.09966 0.01648 0.00482 0.3388 0.0385 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("‘hay’; [oy] is like the ‘oy’ of ‘boy’; [ew] is like the ‘e’ of ‘egg’ followed by ‘w’; [w] is the English" 0.09195 0.90815 0.09967 0.11616 0.11616 0.01648 0.00482 0.3598 0.0471 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("‘w’ but with well-rounded lips. Other signs should be given their usual Spanish pronunciation." 0.09195 0.90045 0.11617 0.13265 0.13265 0.01648 0.00482 0.3445 0.0268 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("[ñ] must be distinguished in pronunciation from [ny] as in words like uranio [u-ɾá-nyo] ‘uranium’" 0.09195 0.90797 0.14377 0.16167 0.16167 0.01648 0.00482 0.3757 0.0240 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("and huraño [u-ɾá-ño] ‘grumpy’/‘unsociable’." 0.09195 0.46745 0.16027 0.17817 0.17817 0.01648 0.00482 0.3143 0.0326 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
  ("[ʎ] must be distinguished from [ly] in words like pollo [pó-ʎo] ‘chicken’ (for cooking) and polio" 0.09195 0.90818 0.18896 0.20686 0.20686 0.01648 0.00482 0.3139 0.0225 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" nil)
